Package: stagemap
Title: Relation Maps for 'Shiny' and 'Quarto'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Harsh", "Verma", email = "analyticswithharsh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Draws maps of cards placed by stage and lane and joined by typed
    links, as an interactive widget, in 'Shiny' apps and in 'Quarto' documents.
    Checks card identifiers, link endpoints and column values, and lays the map
    out the same way on every run. Functions trace links from a card and list
    cards with no link, or with no link to a given stage.
